WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:05.870
<i>A mysterious man named Diabal
 lives deep within Caislean Merlin Castle.</i>

00:00:06.570 --> 00:00:09.980
<i>He and his unsettling Shadows
 control the Spectre Nemesis.</i>

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.490
<i>What could they be plotting?</i>

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:17.830
<i>Seth knows nothing of the dire situation
 he has found himself in.</i>

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:55.010
<b>Seth in the Forest of Time 
-Caillte-</b>

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:52.810
<i>"Seth in the Forest of Time."</i>

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.150
<i>He escaped?</i>

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:05.260
<i>Impossible!
 After the hit he took from Diabal?</i>

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:07.620
<i>We need to seal this hole
 with an illusion.</i>

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:10.520
<i>Look down there.</i>

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:13.100
<i>Myr?</i>

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:17.560
<i>Oh, it's just a senile old man 
playing with some flowers.</i>

00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:19.990
<i>Even if the great Merlin came back,</i>

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:23.530
<i>and he was the one who found Merlin,
 no one would believe him.</i>

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:26.050
Did you find his body?

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:26.910
<i>No.</i>

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:29.740
Well, do whatever it takes 
to find and kill him!

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:32.050
Before my hiding place is discovered!

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:34.920
<i>Just who was that boy?</i>

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.790
He's related to the guy 
who gave me these scars.

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:48.930
Okay, it's all clear now.

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:54.730
Thanks for hiding him for me.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:57.810
I'll come visit you again soon.

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:03.380
I don't think I can heal this,

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:06.980
but luckily for him, my wife can.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.100
What was that I just felt?

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:13.700
Doc!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:15.290
Melie?

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.090
I think Seth is in trouble!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.220
Wh-What?!

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:27.160
Well, isn't this strange?

00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:29.480
There are fragments of the wall here,

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.290
but I don't see any breaks in the wall.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:35.860
Was it an attack from outside?

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.590
Where could an attack have come from?

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:41.110
Besides, they couldn't get over
 the castle wall.

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:43.340
Good point...

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.220
Ocoho.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.020
Melie.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.900
Who's this little kid?

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:53.990
I'm older than you are!

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.750
Sheesh! So, who is this?

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:00.470
She's Ocoho, a knight apprentice.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.380
She says she's been with Seth 
since he arrived at the castle.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.260
That's it! Seth!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:08.040
Have you guys seen Seth?

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:11.130
I came here because I heard 
there was an explosion.

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:13.390
I hope Seth didn't have 
anything to do with it.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:14.890
You bet he did!

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:18.310
When something this weird happens, 
Seth's always involved!

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:19.660
He's right.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.950
It's very faint,

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:25.410
but I can sense traces 
of Seth's Fantasia.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.650
Amazing!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:30.590
Melie's an excellent Ambush Hunter.

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:42.610
Vestigia Invenire!

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.020
That way!

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.910
The tracer disappeared?

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:09.830
Because it left the castle!

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:14.460
All magic disappears
 when it passes through this gate!

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.210
In that case...

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:22.090
Vestigia Invenire!

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:29.830
It went into the forest?

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:38.350
It's just too hard to run 
with these short legs.

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:40.990
I'm gonna rest right here!

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:44.230
Ow, ow! I'll go! I'll go!

00:05:44.230 --> 00:05:45.600
Let's hurry.

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:46.890
Wait!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:52.240
Caillte's forest is protected 
by ancient, powerful magic.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:56.770
As soon as you go in,
 you get lost and never come out!

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:58.500
What?!

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:02.790
It's so dangerous, even the
 Knights-sorcerers won't go in!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.820
All right.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:08.010
Let's go around the forest.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.100
I'll go by myself.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:12.390
W-Wait!

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.930
What is this place?

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:50.210
You idiot!

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:53.810
Why don't you and Seth ever listen?!

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:54.710
Ocoho! Ocoho! Ocoho!

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:56.030
How do you expect to get out of here?!

00:06:56.030 --> 00:07:00.580
That's easy.
 If we just go back the way we came...

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:06.730
Huh? I thought there was a thicket there.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:43.830
Did you feel that?
 Its presence is overwhelming.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:47.420
I don't wanna be eaten!

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:50.050
I'm sorry. This is my fault.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:50.050
Please, no!

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:52.240
No apologizing now!

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:55.020
Talking like that
 won't get us anywhere.

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:58.870
If we all work together,
 we'll find our way out of this forest.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.620
Either that or we'll all die like dogs.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.250
We have two things to do!

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:07.000
We're gonna save Seth,
 then we're all getting out of here!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.220
Right!

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:15.760
Keep it down!
 That monster's gonna find us!

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.020
What's the matter?

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.100
It's gone?

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.520
But where did it go?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.430
The question is not "where,"
 but "when."

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:31.800
Come on, Myr.
 We don't have time for your riddles.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.530
Wait! Myr?!

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.210
What a coincidence, eh?

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:40.160
I was just enjoying a nice walk
 to keep my health up.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:43.230
In this place full of monsters?!

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:46.000
Well, what a surprise!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.630
You three can see me?

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:49.880
Of course we can!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:54.080
Just the fact that
 you haven't gotten lost is impressive.

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:56.220
Uh, we've been lost for a long time.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:57.640
In that case...

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.890
Would you three like to go see my wife, too?

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:05.330
Myr, I'm sorry, but we're busy.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:06.330
We're looking for Seth—

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:07.780
You mean him?

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.520
Seth!

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:13.150
What happened to Seth?!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:16.150
These are no ordinary injuries.

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:18.900
They'll need a certain degree of healing.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:32.420
Those look just like tortibri.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:36.800
And that plant...

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:40.570
I've seen it in the
 <i>Sextus Apuleius</i> field guide.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:45.330
These are all thought to be extinct.

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:48.560
If they're real, this is a huge discovery.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:51.780
Why doesn't the forest's magic
 affect you, Myr?

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:53.070
Magic?

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:54.570
You know about it, right?

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:57.450
Anyone who enters this forest gets lost

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.980
and can end up trapped here for decades.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:01.020
Huh?

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:04.170
The legends say it's a powerful spell 
the great Merlin cast

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:07.370
to protect the castle from enemies.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:11.930
Honestly, you people are unbelievable!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.230
When you don't understand something,

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:19.140
you come up with some random thing 
to justify your ignorance.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:23.040
It's true that this forest confounds people.

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:26.640
But there's no magic spell on it.

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:28.890
We're here.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:32.980
You look even more beautiful 
than usual today!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:43.410
Welcome home, Myr!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.370
Yes, I'm home!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.540
I brought some visitors.

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.940
Oh, my! A bouquet of humans?

00:10:49.940 --> 00:10:51.170
How lovely!

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.170
Put them in this vase!

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:58.680
I'm just joking.
 What funny faces you're making.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:01.170
I don't put humans in vases.

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:04.180
We have morals, you know!

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:10.440
We wait until they die,
 <i>then</i> we pluck them up and decorate with them.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:13.540
I-I'll never pick a living flower again!

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.120
Me, neither!

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:17.940
I'll decorate with rocks from now on!

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:19.730
She's just kidding.

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:23.750
My wife is as gentle as spring moss.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:28.160
Oh? What's that smell?

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:33.060
Have you been loafing
 among those city plants again?

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:35.710
No, no, of course not!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.170
It's no use lying to me.

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:40.630
There's a leaf in your beard.

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:44.610
This is just...
 from when I leaned on a tree!

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:48.100
I was writing a song just for you!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:52.460
Ahem! Listen to this song 
I wrote for you out of love!

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:53.620
Excuse me!

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:58.600
We heard that you can heal Seth.

00:11:58.600 --> 00:12:01.500
Oh, my. That human is nearly wilted.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:02.990
Please!

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:05.490
Please help Seth!

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:14.960
<b>[Caillte Forest] 
A mysterious forest where Melie and company were lost.
 There are extinct animals and plants...</b>

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.720
Can you see it?

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:35.620
There's a strange orb around him,
 almost like a wall.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:38.730
I couldn't get through it.

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.400
What's that inside the orb?

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:45.420
I grew a tree into it.

00:12:45.420 --> 00:12:47.740
Oh? That's brilliant.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.120
Wh-What are you guys?!

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.770
Oh, sorry about that!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.000
Myr?!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.710
That's right.

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.690
And this is my wife, Jill.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:06.620
Your wife?!

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.370
Ain't she a beauty?

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.020
Oh, Myr!

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:13.240
But what are you doing inside my head?

00:13:13.240 --> 00:13:15.200
Inside your head?

00:13:15.200 --> 00:13:18.630
Wrong! How self-centered you are!

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:19.270
Huh?

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:23.260
This is a spiritual dimension called Sidh.

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:24.780
"Sidh"?

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.860
Yes, Sidh.

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:28.930
It exists within everyone,

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:32.740
but not everyone is able to access it.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:37.020
Once you get used to it, you can
 discover the consciousnesses of others

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:40.670
and communicate with them 
through Sidh itself.

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:44.260
Now, Seth...

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:49.180
What is this thing inside you?

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.330
I'm... not sure.

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:54.500
But for some reason, I sense Piodon.

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:58.440
He's a guy who called himself my brother.

00:14:07.340 --> 00:14:10.200
What are they doing?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:13.830
It looks like... they're napping.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.610
Surely not...

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:20.210
Um...

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.090
Are they actually napping?!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:26.500
No! Don't you feel it?

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:29.830
Myr and Jill are communicating with Seth!

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:31.340
Communicating?

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:32.700
What do you mean?

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:37.620
I do sort of get the feeling 
they're connected somehow, but...

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:40.040
Maybe it's because of the
 power of this forest.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.610
My senses normally aren't very sharp,

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:45.330
but I can sense things 
really clearly right here!

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:46.860
Oh, right!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.220
There.

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:49.850
Wh-What are you doing?

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:51.820
U-Um...

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:03.730
You lost consciousness after being poisoned,
 and then this orb appeared?

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:04.670
Yeah.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:09.010
It swallowed me up,
 and I couldn't tell what was going on.

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.260
I lost all control.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:14.010
I destroyed everything.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:18.020
Is that going to keep happening
 from now on?

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:21.020
It is likely.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.520
What in the world is this?

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:29.180
Either it has its own will,

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:32.340
or it's subservient to yours.

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:37.540
Or perhaps it's subservient
 to this Piodon you spoke of.

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:41.610
I was able to restrain it temporarily,

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:45.920
but because of that thing,
 you're caught between life and death.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.930
Huh?! I'm about to die?!

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:51.170
I can heal your wounds.

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:56.430
But if I wake you up,
 Myr's magic will wear off.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:01.090
And then I'll lose control again?

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:05.150
Yes, if you cannot learn 
to control that thing.

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:12.100
I can't.

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:17.950
It's better if I stay like this.

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:19.370
Stop it!

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:24.120
Melie?!

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:30.930
You brought her here?

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:31.880
Yep.

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:33.630
Nicely done.

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:37.820
This is no time to get all giddy!

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:42.600
Just look at me!
 You obviously messed up!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:46.650
Th-That's strange.
 Wh-What could have happened?

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:55.940
We have to leave!

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:58.320
What? But they're...

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:01.590
I can't stay like this!
 It's worse than being a baby!

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:03.670
Let us out of here right now!

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:04.980
Well...

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:07.240
I'm leaving, I said!

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:08.520
Come on, come on!

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:11.550
A-All right, all right!

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.560
Why are you acting so weak?

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:31.070
This isn't like you.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.570
I'm scared.

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:42.310
It tries to swallow me up
 every time I let my guard down.

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:46.210
Fighting it is useless. 
Screaming is useless.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:51.670
In fact, I feel like the more I fight it,
 the stronger it gets.

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:54.960
What am I supposed to do?

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:59.820
So you're just going to mope
 in here forever?

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:02.460
Please understand.

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:04.970
Understand what?

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:08.710
This completely helpless feeling.

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:13.530
If there's anyone who can
 understand it, it's you.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:20.830
You and I aren't the only ones
 who understand that.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:25.040
Doc does, and so does everyone else.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:27.820
Everyone has things
 that don't go the way they want.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.340
But we go on living.

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:32.500
Just the way you have to...

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:34.250
Yeah, but...

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:40.260
What if you ended up
 destroying everything you touched?

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:46.350
Your house, Boobrie, Doc... or me?

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:50.460
Would you still let people 
get close to you?

00:18:50.460 --> 00:18:52.270
Would you still touch them?!

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:59.530
I can't do it.

00:19:04.050 --> 00:19:05.650
You know, Melie...

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:09.740
This thing inside me
 and your curse act on their own.

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:12.550
They won't do what we tell them to.

00:19:14.740 --> 00:19:19.550
Do you think this is something
 you can ever control on your own?

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.470
No.

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:29.510
I can't do that.

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:34.750
But, Seth...

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:40.460
You weren't afraid of my curse.

00:19:40.870 --> 00:19:44.320
I don't even know why, 
but you trusted me.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.890
You saved me.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:52.910
You made me feel as though
 my curse wasn't a curse.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:58.380
You treated it like just another part
 of my personality.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:04.150
I actually started to believe 
maybe it really was just that.

00:20:12.590 --> 00:20:16.460
You and I aren't the same.

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:22.140
That's why I know that
 <i>you</i> can do something about it.

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:27.060
No, I can't.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.650
Not by myself.

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:39.230
Melie, I'm glad I have you.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.260
Seth...

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:44.090
I have no idea what this thing is.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.910
But the more I talk to you,

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:50.060
the less I feel that I'll do anything bad.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:54.990
I thought I had to take care of it on my own,

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.570
but I was wrong.

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:02.090
I don't want to turn my back
 on you anymore,

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:05.110
but I can't put you in danger, either.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.410
So I have no choice.

00:21:09.590 --> 00:21:11.690
I'll get this thing under control.

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:12.660
I swear it.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.990
Seth...

00:21:17.990 --> 00:21:19.870
Why are you laughing?

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.180
You haven't noticed?

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:23.420
Noticed what?

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:25.800
The way you're talking.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:27.890
I'm just talking normally—

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.580
You've changed, Melie.

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.390
You think so?

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:37.440
It's a sign of your trust in me.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:40.420
Come on! It's nothing like that!

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:43.420
Oh, darn it! Now I can't go back!

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:47.450
Jeez, Seth!

00:21:49.150 --> 00:21:50.100
Melie...

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:53.180
Thanks.

00:22:02.730 --> 00:22:04.960
Oh? She's awake.

00:22:04.960 --> 00:22:08.180
This one seems much better now, too.

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:09.840
How was Seth?

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:11.660
Is he okay?

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:14.650
It seems he's ready to leave Sidh now.

00:22:14.650 --> 00:22:16.340
Oh, good.

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:19.850
But he said he's going 
to stay in this forest

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:22.480
and train with Myr for a while.

00:22:22.480 --> 00:22:24.100
What?!

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.740
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.950 --> 00:24:06.570
<i>In order to learn how to control 
the rampaging power within him,</i>

00:24:06.570 --> 00:24:10.300
<i>Seth begins his new training 
with Myr and Jill.</i>

00:24:10.860 --> 00:24:13.860
<i>Through his training with Myr, 
he learns how to feel nature,</i>

00:24:13.860 --> 00:24:16.660
<i>and the true essence of Fantasia.</i>

00:24:16.660 --> 00:24:20.480
<i>Then he finally confronts the dark power
 Piodon placed inside him.</i>

00:24:20.740 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>The Palace of Schemes 
-Palace-</b>

00:24:20.940 --> 00:24:24.190
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, 
"The Palace of Schemes."</i>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>By the way, Seth...
 How exactly do we get out of here?</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>Uh...</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
